---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoMemSliceMapDemo from '../demos/GoMemSliceMapDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gms-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Interactive memory simulator: Go code vs heap backing array & map buckets" titleVi="Mô phỏng bộ nhớ động: Code Go đối chiếu mảng nền slice & bucket map">
    <GoMemSliceMapDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Watch highlighted Go lines update the live heap diagram: see how s1[1:3] writes over s1[3] in place until capped with s1[1:3:3] or copied, and why deleting 99% of map keys keeps buckets pinned.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Xem từng dòng code Go làm thay đổi vùng nhớ trên Heap: s1[1:3] sẽ ghi đè trực tiếp lên s1[3] nếu không khóa cap bằng s1[1:3:3] hoặc copy, và bảng bucket của map vẫn giữ nguyên dù đã delete 99% key.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gms-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gms-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gms-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gms .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(155px, 1fr)); }
  .gms .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gms .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gms .sd-stat b { font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }

  .gms-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .gms-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gms-pane { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .gms-pane-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .gms-code-body {
    padding: 8px 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .gms-line { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 12px; white-space: pre; color: var(--text-body); transition: background-color 0.2s; }
  .gms-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 18px; }
  .gms-line.is-active { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .gms-line.is-active.is-bad { background: var(--red-tint-bg); color: var(--red); }
  .gms-line.is-active.is-good { background: rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.14); color: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gms-line.is-active.is-good { background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.15); color: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gms-flow-svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 6px; }
  .gms-flow-svg text { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gms-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gms-box.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gms-box.is-good { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gms-box.is-good { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gms-svg-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gms-svg-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gms-svg-good { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gms-svg-good { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gms-svg-sm { font-size: 10.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }

  .gms-arrays { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .gms-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg-alt); }
  .gms-row-lbl { min-width: 150px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
  .gms-row-lbl.is-good { color: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gms-row-lbl.is-good { color: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gms-cells { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .gms-cell { min-width: 58px; padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--bg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .gms-cell small { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gms-cell strong { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gms-cell.is-shared { border-color: var(--gold); background: var(--gold-tint-bg); }
  .gms-cell.is-bad { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gms-cell.is-bad strong { color: var(--red); }
  .gms-cell.is-good { border-color: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gms-cell.is-good { border-color: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gms-cell.is-good strong { color: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .gms-cell.is-good strong { color: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gms-note { margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-alt); font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
